<title>USA: NYSE Unavailables - Stanhome.</title>
<headline>NYSE Unavailables - Stanhome.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said that Stanhome Inc was unavailable for after hours trade for news.</p>
<p>After the market closed, Stanhome said it expects to report earnings of $0.63 to $0.64 a share, and an operating loss at its Stanhome Direct Sellling unit for the third quarter.</p>
<p>The NYSE said that Fruehauf Trailer Corp and Corimon SACA were also unavialalbe for after hours trade.</p>
</text>
